If you are thinking about moving to an SSD storage array or a host, then we would recommend that you consider the Triton 3-way switch. With the Triton 3-way switch, you will be able to connect drives from different manufacturers and with different read/write patterns. The switch will also offer a maximum capacity of 64TB. 
To move to a solid-state drive or a host, we recommend the Triton 3-way SDV. With the Triton 3-way SDV, you will be able to connect drives from different manufacturers and with different read/write patterns. The switch will also offer a maximum capacity of 64 TB.
